      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A workshop aimed at extension developers who wish to update their extensions for the upcoming Firefox 3 release. It is not exclusive to Firefox extensions, authors of extensions for other Mozilla-based software are welcome.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
